<title>The Sahel insurgency: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/sahel/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-sahel-2026-11-04T06:46:23.635Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 06:46:23 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Algerian forces have entered Niger to protect energy interests, adding a state actor to the Sahel insurgency. Armed terrorists are moving across the Kaduna River toward Shiroro in Niger State, extending the conflict’s geographic scope. Islamist militants continue abducting Islamic school students in Niger State, while bandits detonated dynamite while smuggling explosives to Burkina Faso, causing a deadly explosion. Journalists remain vulnerable, with twelve of thirteen killed since 2006 still lacking justice. The UCDP recorded 4,159 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxOd1NKTllUNTJiakU5RGdaNFRwekM3SnNaeC1tUGw0QWNvOGNsVkI2SkpPVFlXNDlKR3FSTTBvTTRDdVpTbk93YnVmVjIzencyVmxUN3BZRmdGQ1EwcXZSTW5sUTdGQTROZHpFZ1ByY2wzdzRlMWlmZjA3T05xcGx6MHQ1TEZqU3Zvc1kw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sri Lanka Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTFBGT1RjejE5QkpYMlJkRm01ZWVLeWlBbnNtdGVBRUFVSHM1NXdPSnBPaDBfOWdqdklIVnZyNTBsOHR0YzZZZHlJcEhPcy05a1N6UFJfcHM4b29zbndoM0HSAWNBVV95cUxPc3BzWlV6ZXZyZkNSbzAwSzRGTmtiNkRsUEtKVWhxNXhkaUZkRThMa2owUVU4eGVOMnNqamY1TFBaTWNCSUYxTzF0ZG1Tb1I2bFNOb01DMTByczVoMG13MFdhUDg?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXEFVX3lxTE5oT2RKWWJoT2VJVi0xcnlZWXFiMVZtUXVFUmF1VHBXTVZVRGtnQmplWU00XzZVZHJVRmVubWRGY3NEOFlZVnNCVTM5cTczc05CX21QUlg2OHRBY1p1?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxOVUJaRHBjb1NjZnp6YUpzNzhzbjhaY3FucjBnaW9DR2VwVDBoMzl6cmVaUEtUNlczNnF1T3NMSUY0eVhCTzl4czFibkpNT0dKbURmVzdkd3ZQczhpdFlKMVQwZDBiNF9YN0dkTTQzS2lHUTVSTnNTcFhmdGVnNGdWUHRVNmwxT1Q3R0lETkdxZFJiQ0pqUnNFR1dBd3RlU0MteXV0blJVcw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Escudo Digital&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikAFBVV9